{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Use the attached reference image as the visual benchmark. I want this section to match the same premium shopping experience, spacing, proportions, and scrolling behavior. Do not build a traditional Shopify product grid.
    Overall Layout
    Build this section as a horizontal product carousel, not a grid.
    The carousel must remain on one single horizontal line.
    Products should never wrap onto a second row.
    On desktop, show exactly 4 product cards inside the viewport.
    If there are more than 4 products, the remaining products should continue horizontally outside the screen.
    The user should discover more products naturally by scrolling sideways.
    Scrolling Behaviour
    The scrolling experience is extremely important.
    Allow users to navigate products by:
    Trackpad horizontal swipe
    Mouse wheel converted into horizontal scrolling
    Click and drag on desktop
    Touch swipe on mobile
    Touch swipe on tablets
    Scrolling should feel smooth with momentum.
    Use CSS Scroll Snap so every product snaps perfectly into position.
    Hide the scrollbar completely while keeping scrolling fully functional.
    Scrolling should feel similar to:
    Apple Store
    Nike
    Nothing
    Perfect Snacks
    Arc Browser website
    Card Layout
    Every product card should have identical dimensions.
    Large white card.
    Rounded corners around 20px.
    Very subtle border.
    Soft premium shadow.
    24px padding.
    Large breathing space.
    No unnecessary visual clutter.
    The card hierarchy should be:
    Top
    Dynamic Bestseller badge (if product has tag)
    ↓
    Large product image
    ↓
    Product title
    ↓
    Variant / Pack Size
    ↓
    Price
    ↓
    Compare-at price (if available)
    ↓
    Discount badge
    ↓
    Full width Add to Cart button
    Bottom
    Product Image
    The product image should be the hero.
    Occupy around 60–65% of the card height.
    Never crop.
    Never distort.
    Maintain aspect ratio.
    Automatically adapt to products of different sizes.
    Keep every image visually aligned.
    Dynamic Shopify Data
    Everything should come directly from Shopify.
    Do NOT hardcode anything.
    Use Shopify Product object for:
    Product Image
    Product Title
    Price
    Compare Price
    Discount
    Availability
    Badge
    Variant
    Collection
    This section should automatically work with any future products.
    Things NOT to Include
    Remove all unnecessary marketing elements.
    Do NOT include:
    ❌ No Palm Oil
    ❌ High Fiber
    ❌ Healthy Choice
    ❌ Ingredient Icons
    ❌ Feature Icons
    ❌ Benefit Rows
    ❌ Long descriptions
    ❌ Product claims
    ❌ Nutrition highlights
    ❌ Decorative graphics
    ❌ Background illustrations
    The packaging itself should provide all the visual color.
    Hover Animation
    Hover should feel expensive.
    When hovering:
    Card lifts upward by around 8px.
    Shadow becomes slightly stronger.
    Product image scales to 103%.
    Button slightly brightens.
    Wishlist icon fades in.
    Quick View fades in.
    Animation duration:
    250ms
    Use cubic-bezier easing.
    Add to Cart Button
    Full width.
    Height around 52px.
    Rounded.
    Premium.
    Smooth hover animation.
    No harsh shadows.
    High contrast.
    Card Spacing
    Leave generous whitespace.
    24px between cards.
    Consistent spacing everywhere.
    Nothing should feel cramped.
    Responsive Behaviour
    Desktop
    Exactly 4 cards visible.
    Laptop
    Still 4 cards.
    Tablet
    3 cards visible.
    Mobile
    Only 1.2–1.3 cards visible.
    The next card should slightly peek into view so users instantly understand the section is swipeable.
    Carousel Controls
    Do NOT add left/right arrow buttons unless necessary.
    The primary navigation should be swipe and horizontal scrolling.
    Optionally show a subtle fading gradient on the left and right edges indicating more products are available.
    Visual Style
    The entire section should feel like a premium Direct-to-Consumer brand.
    Reference quality:
    Apple Store
    Nike
    Nothing
    Perfect Snacks
    Aesop
    Ritual
    Allbirds
    Minimal.
    Editorial.
    Luxury.
    High-end.
    Modern.
    Lots of whitespace.
    Performance
    The carousel should support unlimited Shopify products without breaking.
    Cards must always remain on a single horizontal row.
    Never create a second row.
    Never switch to a masonry or grid layout.
    Keep scrolling extremely smooth at 60 FPS.
    Goal
    The final result should look like a premium product showcase instead of a standard Shopify collection. The experience should encourage users to swipe through products naturally while keeping the interface clean, elegant, modern, and highly conversion-focused. The carousel should be fully dynamic, pulling all products from Shopify collections automatically without requiring manual updates in the future.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc((100% - (3 * {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px)) / 4);
    min-width: calc((100% - (3 * {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px)) / 4);
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow_x }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_y }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    transition: transform 250ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), box-shadow 250ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-{{ block.settings.hover_lift }}px);
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow_x }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_y }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_color }};
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    left: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    background: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 0;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_aspect_ratio }}%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.content_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transition: transform 250ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-premium-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.content_spacing }}px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__variant-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.variant_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.variant_color }};
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.price_font_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.compare_price_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.compare_price_color }};
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__discount-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.discount_badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.discount_badge_text_color }};
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.discount_badge_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.discount_badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.button_height }}px;
    background: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 250ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), transform 250ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    margin-top: auto;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__gradient-left-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-premium-carousel__gradient-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 60px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 300ms ease;
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__gradient-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    left: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, {{ block.settings.gradient_color }}, transparent);
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__gradient-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    right: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to left, {{ block.settings.gradient_color }}, transparent);
  }

  .ai-premium-carousel__gradient-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}.visible,
  .ai-premium-carousel__gradient-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}.visible {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-premium-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - (2 * {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px)) / 3);
      min-width: calc((100% - (2 * {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px)) / 3);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-premium-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(100% / 1.3);
      min-width: calc(100% / 1.3);
    }

    .ai-premium-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-premium-carousel__wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.show_gradients %}
      <div class="ai-premium-carousel__gradient-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      <div class="ai-premium-carousel__gradient-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-premium-carousel__track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-carousel-track>
      {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
        {% for product in block.settings.collection.products limit: block.settings.products_limit %}
          <div class="ai-premium-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.show_bestseller_badge %}
              {% if product.tags contains block.settings.bestseller_tag %}
                <div class="ai-premium-carousel__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.bestseller_text }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            {% endif %}

            <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-premium-carousel__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if product.featured_image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-premium-carousel__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="800"
                  height="{{ 800 | times: block.settings.image_aspect_ratio | divided_by: 100 }}"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-premium-carousel__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </a>

            <div class="ai-premium-carousel__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-premium-carousel__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a>
              </h3>

              {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
                <div class="ai-premium-carousel__variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.title }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              <div class="ai-premium-carousel__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <span class="ai-premium-carousel__price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ product.price | money }}
                </span>

                {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                  <span class="ai-premium-carousel__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ product.compare_at_price | money }}
                  </span>

                  {% if block.settings.show_discount_badge %}
                    {% assign discount_percentage = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}
                    <span class="ai-premium-carousel__discount-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      -{{ discount_percentage }}%
                    </span>
                  {% endif %}
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <form action="/cart/add" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
                <button
                  type="submit"
                  class="ai-premium-carousel__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
                >
                  {% if product.available %}
                    {{ block.settings.button_text }}
                  {% else %}
                    {{ block.settings.sold_out_text }}
                  {% endif %}
                </button>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {% for i in (1..8) %}
          <div class="ai-premium-carousel__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-premium-carousel__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-premium-carousel__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-premium-carousel__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Product Title</h3>
              <div class="ai-premium-carousel__variant-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Variant Option</div>
              <div class="ai-premium-carousel__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <span class="ai-premium-carousel__price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">₹999</span>
              </div>
              <button class="ai-premium-carousel__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.button_text }}
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PremiumCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.track = null;
        this.gradientLeft = null;
        this.gradientRight = null;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('[data-carousel-track]');
        this.gradientLeft = this.querySelector('.ai-premium-carousel__gradient-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.gradientRight = this.querySelector('.ai-premium-carousel__gradient-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}');

        if (!this.track) return;

        this.enableHorizontalScroll();
        this.updateGradients();

        this.track.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          this.updateGradients();
        });

        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
          this.updateGradients();
        });
      }

      enableHorizontalScroll() {
        this.track.addEventListener('wheel', (e) => {
          if (e.deltaY !== 0) {
            e.preventDefault();
            this.track.scrollLeft += e.deltaY;
          }
        }, { passive: false });
      }

      updateGradients() {
        if (!this.gradientLeft || !this.gradientRight) return;

        const scrollLeft = this.track.scrollLeft;
        const maxScroll = this.track.scrollWidth - this.track.clientWidth;

        if (scrollLeft > 20) {
          this.gradientLeft.classList.add('visible');
        } else {
          this.gradientLeft.classList.remove('visible');
        }

        if (scrollLeft < maxScroll - 20) {
          this.gradientRight.classList.add('visible');
        } else {
          this.gradientRight.classList.remove('visible');
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PremiumCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

